      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{619ffdfe00e2a864e7efb2e1|full_name}: I do agree, worlds should take priority if an udon script wants to take control.\n\nThe main idea was for avatar authors to limit or disable this functionality if they don't think it fits the avatar.",
