  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The avatar scaling functionality is a lot of fun, however, some authors may want to limit the range of how much the avatar can scale. Some animations or effects may brake at too far of an extreme.\n\nMy suggestion: Have an optional value settable (within the limits) in the SDK or Avatar descriptor for the minimum and maximum scale.\n\nThis way the author can choose if they want their short avatar to stay short. If they don't care about scale. It can revert to default.",
